DESCRIPTION:Join the Longmont Symphony for a whimsical and unforgettable journey through Michael Close’s A Child’s Book of Animals\, where you’ll hop with frogs\, soar with seagulls\, dive with octopuses and meet a swan with big dreams of becoming a rapper. The program also features the exhilarating finale of Sibelius’ Symphony No. 2\, performed side-by-side with the talented musicians from the Longmont Youth Symphony\, and a showcase of the winner of our new Concerto Competition. It’s a concert full of imagination\, inspiration and extraordinary music for all ages.\n\nLink: https://www.downtownlongmont.com/do/lso-family-concert-a-childs-book-of-animals
DTEND:20260118T000000Z
LOCATION:Longmont Symphony Orchestra
DTSTART:20260117T230000Z
SUMMARY:🎵 [Classical] LSO Family Concert: A Child’s Book of Animals
UID:530784f7-993a-433d-85a0-63bfd7bb4d63@5307.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:$25 cover\nBuy your pre-sales tickets in the taproom or at https://www.ticketleap.events/tickets/lmoe-1-24-26.\nPre-sales end on 1/23 and then you can buy your tickets at the door after pre-sale ticket holders get in to choose their favorite seat. Additional parking available along 2nd Avenue and Pratt Street.\nLast Men On Earth have been one of the most popular variety rock bands in Northern Colorado for over 10 years.\nAlso featuring members of The Long Run\, and other Northern CO bands\, they have built a reputation for years of not being able to be ‘pigeon-holed’ into one category of music.\nYou will hear hits from rock bands like Journey\, Toto\, Foreigner\, Van Halen\, but you’ll also hear hits from bands like The Commodores\, Zac Brown\, Golden Earring\, Bryan Adams\, and everything in between.\nLast Men On Earth will leave you guessing what lost radio hit they will play next\, that you forgot you loved!\n\nLink: https://www.downtownlongmont.com/do/last-men-on-earth-at-bootstrap-brewing-1
DTEND:20260125T040000Z
LOCATION:Bootstrap Brewing
DTSTART:20260125T010000Z
SUMMARY:🎵 [Rock] Last Men on Earth at Bootstrap Brewing!
UID:4d839621-fd49-4cab-8908-1c114fee9b9f@4d83.org
END:VEVENT
